he receipt)", "w": 390, "x": 1450, "y": 0}, "XsHomeLight.dc.html": {"h": 844, "is_interactive": true, "page": "look-xstitch", "radius": 28, "title": "Home, white aida (tap Add to 3 apps)", "w": 390, "x": 980, "y": 0}, "XsKey.dc.html": {"h": 844, "page": "look-xstitch", "radius": 16, "title": "Chart key: one floss colour and motif per app", "w": 900, "x": 0, "y": 0}, "You.dc.html": {"h": 844, "is_interactive": true, "radius": 28, "title": "You: activity, credits, privacy", "w": 390, "x": 1410, "y": 1340}, "SqClairDark.dc.html": {"x": 1410, "y": 0, "w": 390, "h": 844, "page": "look-soft", "radius": 28, "is_interactive": true, "title": "Clair builds Car, dark (tap Make it)"}, "SqAppearance.dc.html": {"x": 1880, "y": 0, "w": 390, "h": 844, "title": "You, Appearance (tap a background or Light / Dark)", "page": "look-soft", "radius": 28, "is_interactive": true}}, "createdOnFiles": {"at": "2026-11-19T01:35:00Z", "v": 1}, "designSystems": [], "launch": {"view": "canvas"}, "noteOrder": ["row0", "screens", "flows", "links", "onboarding", "row1", "row2", "row3", "row4", "row5", "row6", "row7", "title_docs", "title_specs", "row_links", "link_1", "link_2", "link_3", "link_4", "link_5", "link_6", "link_7", "link_8", "link_9", "title_xs", "title_cb", "title_sl", "genz_note", "title_sq", "sq_note", "sq_decide"], "notes": {"flows": {"fill": "teal", "size": 24, "text": "Click paths (press Play on any board)\n\nDemo: Home > Clair > Photo > Review receipt > Add to 3 apps > See Budget ($412 → $376) > Calendar.\n\nClair: Home > Clair > “Spent $12 on lunch” > Add to 3 apps; the same sheet answers “Can I afford $60 concert tickets?” from Budget. Hold Clair to talk. File > a shared syllabus > Add to 2 apps.\n\nPhoto and ask: a photo with a question gets an answer, not a log (Clair offers “Log these items or just answer?”); receipts still go to Review receipt. Data answers cite your apps; general answers say so and offer a tracker.\n\nComing back: Home > Show 3 more > Clair's evening check-in > Review > Update 3 apps.\n\nBuild: Your apps > New app > Build it > pick a layout > Arrange or Use this layout > Add to my apps > ready.\n\nEverywhere: the pinned bar (Budget, Groceries, Calendar, To-dos) and the Clair button.", "w": 480, "x": -620, "y": 3940}, "genz_note": {"fill": "blue", "page": "look-genz", "size": 24, "text": "Colour Blocks: each app is a solid block of saturated colour, pieced together like a modern solid-colour quilt, with a stitched seam inside each block. Money left is set huge. Archivo, wide and heavy. Dark by default.\n\nSticker Lid: each app is a die-cut sticker with a white keyline on a laptop lid, every one a slightly different shape and tilt. A waiting change is a sticker not yet pressed down (dashed cut line, lifted); Add presses it flat. Unbounded for headlines, Onest for text.", "w": 860, "x": 0, "y": 964}, "link_1": {"href": "https://claude.ai/artifact/Wr2p4rLD6Zgow3uxmSykRV", "kind": "link", "linkKind": "design", "title": "Home prototype: demo start, Clair sheet, thread pull", "x": 0, "y": 10684}, "link_2": {"href": "https://claude.ai/artifact/HrLSUSPiXKCLphYfHVFxne", "kind": "link", "linkKind": "design", "title": "Flows prototype: build an app, rows, sheets, laptop", "x": 720, "y": 10684}, "link_3": {"href": "https://claude.ai/artifact/VPM8mrtefTzb7n6e5GwLAC", "kind": "link", "linkKind": "motion", "title": "Motion catalogue: every animation, playable", "x": 1440, "y": 10684}, "link_4": {"href": "https://claude.ai/artifact/1wAsrxfWhJQYHuinU9J3e8", "kind": "link", "linkKind": "motion", "title": "Workbench Motion Lab", "x": 0, "y": 10876}, "link_5": {"href": "https://claude.ai/artifact/N37FhQVVYTNoeDf4rJFyjq", "kind": "link", "linkKind": "doc", "title": "Quilt Design Book: screens, decisions, prototypes", "x": 720, "y": 10876}, "link_6": {"href": "https://claude.ai/artifact/5tCktoUM9a7rFevzG4CvmH", "kind": "link", "linkKind": "design", "title": "Quilt Design Directions", "x": 1440, "y": 10876}, "link_7": {"href": "https://claude.ai/artifact/Wm8vuPdcqgoTkXsKkRcR4a", "kind": "link", "linkKind": "design", "title": "Quilt Dock Studies", "x": 0, "y": 11068}, "link_8": {"href": "https://claude.ai/artifact/WtBMJUDese1MWWMTjFu8Dd", "kind": "link", "linkKind": "design", "title": "Quilt Dock Studies II", "x": 720, "y": 11068}, "link_9": {"href": "https://claude.ai/artifact/18RnmaVVfa67xA6KwnFnXm", "kind": "link", "linkKind": "doc", "title": "DevDay brief and application drafts (Nov 15)", "x": 1440, "y": 11068}, "links": {"size": 24, "text": "Live versions and docs (Nov 19)\n\nMotion catalogue: every animation, named and playable, with a reduced-motion switch: claude.ai/artifact/VPM8mrtefTzb7n6e5GwLAC\n\nHome prototype (demo start state, Clair sheet, thread pull): claude.ai/artifact/Wr2p4rLD6Zgow3uxmSykRV\n\nFlows prototype (build an app, swipe rows, sheets, pull to search, Just used on the bar): claude.ai/artifact/HrLSUSPiXKCLphYfHVFxne\n\nDocs in the repo: docs/prd.md, docs/ui-tech-plan.md, docs/demo-readiness.md", "w": 480, "x": -620, "y": 6540}, "onboarding": {"fill": "teal", "size": 24, "text": "First open (docs/onboarding.md). Press Play on Welcome and tap through.\n\nWelcome > Start > What slips? (pick Money, Groceries, To-dos) > Make my apps > starter apps appear, pins fill (Calendar last) > Open Home > Clair button > Photo > camera pre-prompt > Continue > Review receipt (row 3: the first basted card) > Add to 3 apps (the first stitched moment).\n\nEvening: check-in > Review > Remind me. Then Keep your quilt > Continue with Google > Add a device (code 482 913) > the laptop: type 482913 to join, anything else shows the error.\n\nBranches: Skip on What slips? goes to the skipped-picks Home (the old Day one board, updated: no name, first prompt). Not now on the camera ask shows the camera-off line. No connection on first open: Try again.", "w": 480, "x": -620, "y": 9240}, "row0": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 2640, "text": "Old design system: Quilter's Workbench (superseded by Soft Quilt)", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": -300}, "row1": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 2270, "text": "Home and finding your apps", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 1040}, "row2": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 3680, "text": "Clair: tell, talk, ask, share", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 2340}, "row3": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 2270, "text": "Demo path: one receipt updates three apps", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 3640}, "row4": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 2740, "text": "Clair builds an app", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 4940}, "row5": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 1800, "text": "Apps made from blocks", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 6240}, "row6": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 6450, "text": "First open: onboarding", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 8940}, "row7": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 1800, "text": "Laptop: the same apps, wider", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 7540}, "row_links": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 2080, "text": "Everything else made for Quilt", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": 10384}, "screens": {"fill": "orange", "size": 24, "text": "Every screen is in Soft Quilt, light mode on Mint air (restyled Nov 19). Dark mode and the ground picker are on the page \"Look: Soft Quilt\".\n\nRow 1 · Home and finding: Home, Your apps, Search, You, Reminder.\nRow 2 · Clair: tap the Clair button, hold it to talk, tell and ask, data vs general questions, a photo with a question, share a file in, a fridge photo that asks what's low, what Clair remembers.\nRow 3 · Demo path: Groceries, Review receipt, Budget, Calendar, Edit an item.\nRow 4 · Clair builds an app: describe, pick a layout, arrange, connect and add, ready; Clair chat.\nRow 5 · Apps made from blocks: Workout (5 tabs), Log a set, To-dos.\nRow 6 · Laptop.\nRow 7 · First open: onboarding, Welcome to second device.\n\nThe main button is Clair: one place to put anything in or ask anything, and it can land in several apps. A receipt is one example. Search is pull-down.\n\nWords: Clair builds “apps”; sections inside an app are “tabs”. Buttons say what happens.", "w": 480, "x": -620, "y": 1340}, "sq_decide": {"page": "look-soft", "size": 24, "text": "Decided Thu 19 Nov\n\nLight mode: Mint air.\nDark mode: Denim dusk.\n\nPeople can pick another ground in You, Appearance (free). The Screens page is restyled to this look in Mint air; the old design-system board is kept as a record.", "w": 860, "x": 940, "y": 964, "fill": "green"}, "sq_note": {"fill": "blue", "page": "look-soft", "size": 24, "text": "Soft Quilt: the Lumo reference in Quilt’s voice (warm, hand-made, calm, plain words, no red). Each app is a pastel patch with a running-stitch edge on a soft gradient ground. A change waiting for your OK has a dashed edge; once added the edge is solid. Frost is used only where content scrolls under it (the pinned bar, Clair’s field). Clair is the spool, never a sparkle. Figtree throughout.\n\nWhat it keeps from the old look: patches, stitches, the basted card, the thread in Next up, the pinned bar.\nWhat it drops: muslin and denim chrome, woven prints, the mustard tag (now a small “just now” pill in the app’s own colour).", "w": 860, "x": 0, "y": 964}, "title_cb": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 860, "page": "look-genz", "text": "Colour Blocks", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": -300}, "title_docs": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 8000, "page": "docs", "text": "Docs for people: pitch, demo day, onboarding, research, setup", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": -300}, "title_sl": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 860, "page": "look-genz", "text": "Sticker Lid", "w": 240, "x": 1100, "y": -300}, "title_specs": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 8000, "page": "specs", "text": "Specs for building: PRD, stories, backend, Clair, UI, decisions, glossary", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": -300}, "title_sq": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 1800, "page": "look-soft", "text": "The look: Soft Quilt", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": -300}, "title_xs": {"kind": "title1", "maxW": 1840, "page": "look-xstitch", "text": "Look option: cross-stitch chart", "w": 240, "x": 0, "y": -300}}, "order": ["Main.dc.html", "DesignSystem.dc.html", "Spool.dc.html", "Tabs.dc.html", "Search.dc.htm